//! JS's typed arrays and the buffers they view (ADR 0283): `Uint8Array`'s
//! bytes, `Float64Array`'s numbers, each element a Rust number of its kind,
//! a `BigInt64Array`'s an `i64`, the `BigInt` rust-js makes one (ADR 0086).
//! Each callback is given an element, or with `_with_index` its index too, and
//! a comparator gives an `Ordering`, as ReScript's Stdlib has them.
//! Generated by `builtins/typed_arrays.ts`; edit the shape there.

